__pycache__/
*.pyc
replay/*.staging

# Checkpoint internals: the RocksDB/HDFS state-store delta files are binary,
# number in the thousands, and are not evidence of anything a reader can check.
# The commit and offset logs ARE the evidence for restart continuity, so those
# are tracked. A reproduction regenerates state from scratch via run_all.sh.
checkpoints/*/state/
checkpoints/*/sources/
